+ * (KW_PARK_ROUND_NS, doubled at each such retry, so that a slow host does
+ * not fail every round) is ended, every held CPU leaving once, until the
+ * cycle's deadline, which ends it with -EBUSY. While the others are
+ * claimed CPU 0 sends no IPI it waits for and takes no lock they could
+ * hold (they are idle).
